  "totalBlocks": 101,
  "translatedBlocks": 101,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8d3f168e88b0138",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们来看看如何利用 Accelerate 库训练大模型，让用户用上 PyTorch FullyShardedDataParallel（FSDP）的最新特性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6a04ebe23f75a6ec",
      "translationZh": "动机 🤗",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69b0cf04d41b7440",
      "translationZh": "随着机器学习模型的规模、大小和参数量不断增长，ML 从业者发现要在自己的硬件上训练甚至加载这样的大模型都很困难。一方面，研究发现大模型学得快（数据和计算高效），性能显著优于小模型 [1]；另一方面，在多数现有硬件上训练这样的模型又让人望而却步。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35e71b44131ebd81",
      "translationZh": "分布式训练是训练这类大型 ML 模型的关键。大规模分布式训练领域近来有几项重要进展，最值得一提的如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae1b21ac9da5c16d",
      "translationZh": "使用 ZeRO（Zero Redundancy Optimizer）的数据并行 [2]",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e8539fbce801e01",
      "translationZh": "阶段 1：在数据并行 worker/GPU 之间分片优化器状态",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4488990496e0c580",
      "translationZh": "阶段 2：在数据并行 worker/GPU 之间分片优化器状态 + 梯度",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f5a29f46ed69360",
      "translationZh": "阶段 3：在数据并行 worker/GPU 之间分片优化器状态 + 梯度 + 模型参数",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd36fcbe1925b165",
      "translationZh": "CPU Offload：在 ZERO 阶段 2 的基础上，把梯度 + 优化器状态卸载到 CPU [3]",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51011c6b31b5291c",
      "translationZh": "张量并行 [4]：模型并行的一种形式，把参数量巨大的单层参数巧妙地分片到多个加速器/GPU 上，实现并行计算的同时避免昂贵的通信同步开销。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c0612e67c8ec915",
      "translationZh": "流水线并行 [5]：模型并行的一种形式，把模型的不同层放到不同的加速器/GPU 上，并用流水线方式让所有加速器同时保持运转。例如，第二块加速器/GPU 在计算第一个微批次时，第一块加速器/GPU 在计算第二个微批次。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1496e8e0fec0d327",
      "translationZh": "3D 并行 [3]：结合使用 ZeRO 数据并行 + 张量并行 + 流水线并行，训练千亿参数量级的巨型模型。例如 BigScience 的 1760 亿参数语言模型就采用了它 [6]。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4161416474305638",
      "translationZh": "本文我们来看使用 ZeRO 的数据并行，特别是 PyTorch 的最新特性 FullyShardedDataParallel（FSDP）。DeepSpeed 和 FairScale 已实现了 ZERO 论文的核心思想，并且都已集成进 transformers Trainer，还配了一篇好博文《Fit More and Train Faster With ZeRO via DeepSpeed and FairScale》[10]。PyTorch 最近把 FairScale 的 FSDP 附加了多项优化后并入了 PyTorch Distributed。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d5fca6866ba8823",
      "translationZh": "Accelerate 🚀：无需改动任何代码即可用上 PyTorch FSDP",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa889324adf8abe8",
      "translationZh": "我们将以 GPT-2 Large（7.62 亿）和 XL（15 亿）两个模型变体做因果语言建模任务。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43f1de8b7db3b434",
      "translationZh": "下面是预训练 GPT-2 模型的代码。它与官方因果语言建模示例类似，只是加了 n_train（2000）和 n_val（500）两个参数，避免在完整数据上做预处理/训练，以便快速完成概念验证基准。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a00c8b9a5ccbea4d",
      "translationZh": "run_clm_no_trainer.py",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79731c4743964ed1",
      "translationZh": "运行 accelerate config 命令后的 FSDP 配置示例：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7aea59254849cf62",
      "translationZh": "多 GPU FSDP",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0b747eca354d7f0",
      "translationZh": "这里我们在单节点多 GPU 设定下做实验，比较 Distributed Data Parallel（DDP）与 FSDP 在各种配置下的表现。先使用 GPT-2 Large（7.62 亿）模型，DDP 在某些批大小下可以工作而不抛出显存不足（OOM）错误；再使用 GPT-2 XL（15 亿）模型，DDP 即使批大小为 1 也会 OOM 失败。我们观察到：FSDP 让 GPT-2 Large 能用更大的批大小，也让 GPT-2 XL 能以像样的批大小训练——这是 DDP 做不到的。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8cee5a60af46540",
      "translationZh": "硬件配置：2 块 24GB NVIDIA Titan RTX GPU。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3f6a3d777bee8fa",
      "translationZh": "训练 GPT-2 Large 模型（7.62 亿参数）的命令：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56cc7ed0816c4b1",
      "translationZh": "FSDP 运行示例：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
