    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "620c2c56747a3281",
      "translationZh": "FSDP（min_num_params = 2K + FULL_SHARD + 卸载到 CPU）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61c8fc192b0d0bff",
      "translationZh": "表 1：在 GPT-2 Large（7.62 亿）模型上对 FSDP 做基准测试",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28ea7372b7a3bcb2",
      "translationZh": "对比 DDP，从表 1 可以看出：不开启和开启 CPU 卸载时，FSDP 分别让最大批大小提升到 2 倍和 3 倍。训练耗时方面，混合精度的 DDP 最快，其后依次是使用 ZERO 阶段 2 和阶段 3 的 FSDP。由于因果语言建模任务的上下文序列长度固定（--block_size），FSDP 带来的训练提速并不算大。对采用动态批大小的应用，能支持更大批大小的 FSDP 很可能带来可观的训练提速。FSDP 的混合精度支持目前在 transformer 上还有一些问题；待支持后，训练提速还会明显改善。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1b4e53df4fe316b6",
      "translationZh": "用 CPU 卸载训练装不进 GPU 显存的巨型模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "499263ce5b9e6c87",
      "translationZh": "训练 GPT-2 XL 模型（15 亿参数）的命令：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52a0f9b65b278850",
